Description: HexTool is a simple calculator for hex, bin and dec.
 HexTool is a simple yet effective calculator/tool; invaluable for people who work with Hex and Binary. 
 Now you can convert between Hex, Binary, Octal and Decimal on the fly. http://sourceforge.net/projects/hextool/
